    rin "「明明说好了的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_75e2ee87:


    "第五节课下课铃响的时候，伦猛地从座位上站起。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_fb1e68e0:


    "然后莽莽撞撞地来到了圣夜子的座位。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_5c84098b:



    voice "2RI_1365"
    rin "「阳菜却不见人影！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_bbbb6acb:



    voice "2MI_1038"
    miyako "「说起来，下午一直没看到她呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_9326f389:



    voice "2RI_1366"
    rin "「又离家出走了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_8d0da40c:



    voice "2MI_1039"
    miyako "「诶？但是没有原因——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_b60c10cc:



    voice "2RI_1367"
    rin "「圣夜夜，能麻烦你帮我说一声我要早退吗？我去找阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_8e8dd6f1:



    voice "2MI_1040"
    miyako "「呃，我是不介意……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_347aaed6:



    voice "2RI_1368"
    rin "「……那条迷路狗！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_ead78129:


    "伦转过身去，这次是莽莽撞撞地冲向了出口。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_a_bf0064fd:



    voice "2MI_1041"
    miyako "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_a_66efb94c:


    "圣夜子在目送伦离开后发呆片刻，朝自己点了点头，把文具收进了书包。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_a_568dcf46:


    "然后她站起身，朝邻桌的女生说道："


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_07_a_3635bdb4:



    voice "2MI_1042"
    miyako "「不好意思，麻烦转告一下夏目、绪方、鹰冈都早退了」"
